---
import ProseLayout from '../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Terms of use"
  kicker="Legal"
  path="/terms/"
  updated={new Date('2026-09-26')}
  description={`The terms that apply when you use ${SITE.name}. In short: the content is general information, check prices with the vendor, and use the site lawfully.`}
>
  <h2>Information, not advice</h2>
  <p>
    Reviews, ratings, guides and calculator results are general information and our editorial
    opinion. They are not financial, legal or tax advice. Always confirm pricing, features and
    contract terms with the vendor before you buy.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep pages accurate and show when each one was last updated, but vendors change
    products and prices without notice. We cannot guarantee that everything is current, and we are
    not responsible for decisions made on the basis of out-of-date information.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party sites</h2>
  <p>
    Links to vendors and other sites are provided for convenience. We do not control those sites
    and are not responsible for their content, products or privacy practices. Some links are
    partner links; see our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    Product names and trademarks belong to their owners and are used only to identify the products
    reviewed. Their use does not imply endorsement by or affiliation with those companies.
  </p>

  <h2>Using our content</h2>
  <p>
    You are welcome to quote short passages with a link back to the source page. Please do not
    republish whole pages without permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
</ProseLayout>
